WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
[Original instrumental music]
OpenBot. A little more possible.
Select Nova. Type a request. Send it.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.500
Open Nova’s computer. Switch to the launch notes.
Read the working context. Return to the conversation.

00:12.500 --> 00:18.500
One team. Working together.
Open the studio’s shared conversation, then select Pixel.

00:18.500 --> 00:24.000
Open the proposed tool plan. Review the file and its scope.
Approve the plan. Pixel builds and checks the tool.

00:24.000 --> 00:29.000
Open the result. See the work.
Preview the launch checklist, with the team’s next steps.

00:29.000 --> 00:38.000
Open Workspace, Settings, then Routines.
Create a launch check-in. Choose weekdays at 8 AM.
Save it. The routine appears in the list.

00:38.000 --> 00:46.000
Bring your subscriptions. Choose your models.
Open Your AI. Choose Pixel’s model and save.
Supported providers and plans; their terms and limits apply.

00:46.000 --> 00:55.500
Create your own teammate. A name, a role, a character and your AI.
Iris joins the sidebar. Start a new conversation.

00:55.500 --> 01:00.000
OpenBot. Your team. Your AI. Open source.
Explore the project on GitHub.
[Music resolves]
